   {
    "h": "Etymology",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "Both the specific name, savignyi, and the common name, Savignyi's fringe-fingered lizard, are in honor of French zoologist Marie Jules César Savigny."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Geographic range",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "A. savignyi is found in Algeria and possibly Morocco."
    ]
